title: file-manager:copy
tags: [[GUI command]] [[file-manager panel]]
kind: reference
summary: File manager: copy the selected entry to the clipboard

Puts the entry under the cursor of the [[file-manager panel]] in the GUI's file clipboard, to be copied where `file-manager:paste` is run. The clipboard is one for the whole GUI: it is shared with the other workspaces and with the ''Copy'' of every panel's right-click menu ([[Context menus]]).
